    <task id="Id_6c15280b-6541-4662-9188-8d313c36c687" name="5.6.4 a) Verification approved">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Revis&amp;atilde;o bem-sucedida&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. definir o estado de conformidade no qual a informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o contida no cont&amp;ecirc;iner de infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o pode ser usada; e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. aprovar o cont&amp;ecirc;iner de infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para compartilhamento&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
